{"final":{"answer":"The net change in Entergy Mississippi, Inc.'s net revenue during 2003 was an increase of $46.4 million, calculated as 2003 net revenue of $426.6 million minus 2002 net revenue of $380.2 million.","value":46.4,"unit":"USD_million","result_id":"tool:1","sources":["source:t4c1n0","source:t1c1n0"],"explanation":"2003 net revenue (source:t4c1n0) = 426.6 USD million; 2002 net revenue (source:t1c1n0) = 380.2 USD million. Change = 426.6 - 380.2 = 46.4 USD million. This is corroborated by the table's components: base rates +48.3 and other -1.9, which sum to 46.4."}}